It seems that screens 7-9 of the latest wanderer (3.2) distribution are
missing.  Included here are the screens as I had them under the prior version
of wanderer.  Additionally, I have taken the liberty to add screens 61 and
62; these are screens written by me (61) and a fellow worker.

Of course, the new screens are not official additions, but I would not mind
being a point of collection for new wanderer screens; if you mail your
screens to me (and solutions) I will periodically post them.

To use this shar file, go into the 'screens' directory that was created
when you unpacked wanderer.  Then 'sh' as indicated below.  (I had to add
a couple of lines to the shar file to move the "end" screen - the old
screen.61 - to screen.63.  Hope that doesn't screw anyone up...)

	John Noble
	jcn@aplvax.jhuapl.edu -or-
	jcn@aplcen.apl.jhu.edu

